  "comments": {
    "d8161a8c": {
      "id": "d8161a8c",
      "node": "71a90aac",
      "posts": [
        {
          "at": "2026-10-08T05:09:21.087Z",
          "author": "claude",
          "body": "The loop: 28 dots take turns lit (r 5.5 → 13 in 0.6 s ease-out 0.22,1,0.36,1; hold ~4 s; back in 0.6 s), each on a 12 s cycle with its own start, about ten lit at once. Drawn here with SVG <animate>, so the exported SVG moves on its own. On the web, use the CSS version under prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference, and show the still mark otherwise."
        }
      ],
      "state": "open"
    }
  },
  "connections": {},
  "decisions": {
    "4a2323f1": {
      "at": "2026-10-08T05:09:20.848Z",
      "by": "claude",
      "id": "4a2323f1",
      "text": "Logo: the hundred-dot field (mia = 100). Full field at 64 px and up, the 4x4 small cut below. One colour; circles only."
    }
  },
